# CAD artifacts are kernel output, not source.
#
# OpenCascade writes trailing whitespace into BREP and STEP, and `git diff
# --check` reports it. The bytes are the geometry: stripping whitespace to
# satisfy a hygiene check would alter an artifact whose volume and signature are
# compared against declared tolerances (S07-C3/C4/C5). Marked binary so git
# neither checks nor normalizes them, and never guesses a line ending.
*.brep binary
*.step binary
*.STEP binary
